      "chunk_id": "PX-500_manual_v3.2.txt_1",
      "text": "PX-500 INDUSTRIAL PUMP\nMaintenance Manual\nVersion: 3.2\n \nSection 1: High Temperature Alarm\n \nAlarm Code: TEMP-HIGH\n \nWhen the pump temperature exceeds the normal operating range, the TEMP-HIGH alarm is triggered.\n \nPossible causes:\n1. Insufficient cooling flow\n2. Low lubrication level\n3. Bearing overheating\n4. Blocked cooling passage\n5. Excessive pump load\n \nRecommended checks:\n1. Check cooling water flow.\n2. Inspect the cooling passage for blockage.\n3. Check bearing temperature.\n4. Check lubric",
