      "chunk_id": "PX-700_manual_v2.1.txt_1",
      "text": "PX-700 INDUSTRIAL PUMP\nMaintenance Manual\nVersion: 2.1\n \nSection 1: High Temperature Alarm\n \nAlarm Code: TEMP-HIGH\n \nWhen the pump temperature exceeds the normal operating range, the TEMP-HIGH alarm is triggered.\n \nPossible causes:\n1. Cooling fan failure\n2. High ambient temperature\n3. Bearing friction\n4. Excessive pump load\n \nRecommended checks:\n1. Check cooling fan operation.\n2. Check ambient temperature.\n3. Inspect bearing condition.\n4. Verify pump load.\n \nFor PX-700 pumps, the normal bearing",
